# 26. What CP-AUTO-004 Does Not Define

This document intentionally does not define:

- the TypeScript implementation
- the exact CLI command syntax
- the MDX parser library
- the YAML/frontmatter library
- the GitHub Action implementation
- the AI model/provider
- prompts for AI review
- automatic rewriting
- automatic PR creation
- automatic merging
- execution of arbitrary security commands
- a new content schema
- a replacement for existing CyberPivot module structures

Those decisions belong to later implementation tickets.

